  "description": "The Vamoose Ranger ST front suspension folding fat tire cycle is a fantastic machine for folks looking for a low step-through cycle that can also be folded to fit in a car or small space for storage or transport.RANGER ST - FRONT SUSPENSION FOLDERThe Vamoose Ranger ST is a 500W rear hub-driven, front suspension, folding cycle that will take you where you want to go and won't be troublesome when you need to take it somewhere. With small folding dimensions, this folding fat tire cycle will fit in a vehicle or small space for storage or transport. This cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• 48V 500W Rear Hub Motor\n\n• 48V 15 Ah Samsung Battery\n\n• KD686 LCD panel\n\n• Cadence sensor\n\n• Front and rear LED lights\n\n• Front and rear fenders\n\nSPECIFICATIONSSPECIFICATIONS\n\nMotor Format:\nSingle Rear\n\nFront Motor:\nN/A\n\nMid Motor:\nN/A\n\nRear Motor:\nBAFANG 48V 500W\n\nDerailleur and shifters:\nSHIMANO Tourny 7 speed\n\nThrottle:\nThrottle w shut off\n\nDisplay:\nKD686\n\nBattery:\n48V 15 Ah Samsung\n\nCharger:\n2A\n\nFront forks :\nVAMOOSE BOXER\n\nRear Suspension:\nn/a\n\nDropper Seat Post:\n\nFrame:\n6061 Aluminum\n\nBrakes:\nTektro hydraulic disc brake, WUXING brake lever with bell\n\nWheels:\n20\" x 4\" Choayang\n\nPedals:\nWellgo\n\nSaddle:\nVelo Black\n\nFront and Rear Racks:\nRear, with front mount option\n\nFenders:\nPlastic\n\nFront and rear lights:\nLED Wired\n\nADDITIONAL ATTRIBUTES\n\nTorque (per motor):\n80 Nm MAX Torque\n\nWatt Hours:\n720\n\nMiles per charge:\n52\n\nKms per charge:\n83.68568\n\nBattery charge time:\n4-6 hrs.\n\nUSB Plugin:\nYES\n\nWEIGHTS AND DIMENSIONS\n\nBox dimensions (cm):\n148 x 30 x 71\n\nBox dimensions (inch):\n58 x 12 x 28\n\nWeights (metric):\n33kgs NW / 41kgs GW\n\nWeights (imperial):\n73lbs NW / 90lbs GW\n\nMax Speed (metric):\n32 km/h max speed\n\nMax Speed (imperial):\n20 m/h max speed\n\nMax Load:\n300 lbs.",
